{"blocks":[["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-0","Pattern A and B",[]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-20","A live-looping setup for GitP/A in Ableton/Live, with paired audio and MIDI tracks for Pattern A and Pattern B, a full performance capture, commentary, and the Launchpad/Custom/Mode/1 Arrangement controls.",["Pattern A and B"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-241","Record an audio loop alongside its MIDI in Session View. Arrangement Record captures launched clips on the timeline; the performance capture tracks preserve the combined signal.",["Pattern A and B"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-422","Recording routes",["Pattern A and B"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-445","Pattern A and Pattern B audio use external input 3 and feed Performance Audio. Their MIDI feeds Performance MIDI; Performance MIDI has no hardware output, so recorded loops do not replay into the MicroFreak.",["Pattern A and B","Recording routes"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-657","Launchpad to MicroFreak carries live playing to the synth. MicroFreak to Launchpad preserves the existing return route. The commentary microphone uses external inputs 1/2.",["Pattern A and B","Recording routes"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-833","Arm the active Pattern audio/MIDI pair to capture a loop. Keep Performance Audio, Performance MIDI, commentary, and the MIDI bridges armed for Arrangement recording. Disarm the completed Pattern pair before recording the other.",["Pattern A and B","Recording routes"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1065","Audio and MIDI monitoring follow the existing template. Check the interface inputs before recording.",["Pattern A and B","Recording routes"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1251","Declare and compile",["Pattern A and B"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1277","An episode selects this setup with the page property ableton-template:: linking here. Its Ableton Session block overrides tempo or replaces a complete Tracks, Scenes, Locators, or Controls section.",["Pattern A and B","Declare and compile"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1481","GitP/mise/Task/ableton/sync compiles the declaration into a new Live Set.",["Pattern A and B","Declare and compile"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1563","Ableton Session",["Pattern A and B"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1730","Tracks",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1741","Pattern A",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1827","Pattern B",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-1913","Pattern A Audio",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2048","Pattern A MIDI",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2180","Pattern B Audio",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2315","Pattern B MIDI",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2447","Performance Audio",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2585","Performance MIDI",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2720","Commentary",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2843","Launchpad to MicroFreak",["Pattern A and B","Ableton Session","Tracks"]],["GitP/A/Template/Pattern%20A%20and%20B/","source-block-2992